e/Modify list unless a requirement explicitly demands it.\"\n\nR3 explicitly requires ctime and atime access, and D1 explicitly requires using pkg/sys abstractions for this. Since pkg/sys doesn't currently have these fields, the requirement itself demands that I add them there. So modifying pkg/sys is justified by the explicit architectural requirement.\n\nI need to add AccessTime and ChangeTime fields to the FileInfo struct in pkg/sys/sys.go, then populate them from the platform-specific stat structures in sys_darwin.go and sys_linux.go. After that, I can check pkg/format for timestamp formatting options.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12830,"cache_read_input_tokens":45468,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":12830,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8ab6c3f3-6c03-4d5b-9d8b-ea4468f3b690","uuid":"55b7192a-cbf5-4172-8b20-44f7abf815db"}
